  "description": "PREVAIL 2020 Follow-the-sun is a virtual conference devoted to performance, resilience and security in the era of cloud, containers, agile and devops",
  "problemStatement": "In recent times we have seen a growing interest in Agile ways of working, DevOps pipelines and toolchains, microservices development and deployment onto cloud-native container-platforms. \u000b\u000bNot only born-on-the-cloud companies are embracing these new methods and computing paradigms; also more traditional companies and organisations are heavily investing in it.\r\n \r\nThe promises of these new methods and computing paradigms are manifold but the solution complexity increases with potentially devastating effects on non-functional aspects …\r\n \r\nServices from the cloud are expected to be fast, always ON and secure but it requires insight, skill and professionalism to achieve those qualities!\r\n ",
  "outcome": "Onsite conference open to technical professionals from IBM as well as IBM's customers with Livestream, accessible to anyone within IBM as well as a Meetup that is open for local technical professionals. Conference recordings will be made available through the IBM intranet.",
  "finalOutcome": "Very successful PREVAIL 2020 conference that rose the awareness of resiliency both within and outside of IBM especially in the times of a pandemic.",
